<title>UK: Commerzbank adds $150 mln to two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank adds $150 mln to two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to $400 million from $250 million joint lead managers Commerzbank (books) and Painewebber said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *$400 MLN	COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    23.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.012    PAY DATE   L22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.126     REOFFER    97.012    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED FOR $250 MLN ON 25.JUN.97.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
